// d3d12_rsx.cpp — see d3d12_rsx.h for scope. Host-only TU, no /ZW,
// compiled with the emucore include set (same flags as boot_probe.cpp).
// 1.0.36: Slice 1 display blit + Slice 2 scratch RTV / real draws.
// 1.0.40: per-submission-interval list lifetime (open once per flip
// interval; clauses append only) + BOOT-LIST-RESET HRESULT logging +
// present-time magenta clear diagnostic + BOOT-VP-DIAG logging.
// No RPCS3 core file is modified by this TU.

